  "description": "Server-driven phase clock (the client only renders the time it is sent), or on your own the run’s. A deadline is a filled pill. Running: a phase you act in. Waiting: someone else is acting, or a reveal. Urgent: the last 5 seconds. Info: a clock that ends nothing you are doing (the time to a hint, the time on this card, a run’s time): a line, no fill, never urgent. Time is m:ss, as every time on the site (0:33); Label says what the clock is for.",
